FundCallback_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when assets non zero
   ├── when funding market not allowlisted for vault
   │  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
   └── when funding market allowlisted
      ├── when callback not created by factory
      │  └── it should revert with InvalidCallback
      ├── when callback owned by another vault
      │  └── it should revert with InvalidCallback
      └── when callback owned by vault
         ├── given callback has not authorized adapter on Morpho
         │  └── it should revert with CallbackNotAuthorized
         ├── given idToMarketParams returns zero loanToken
         │  └── it should revert with UnknownMarket
         └── given known market
            ├── given Morpho returns zero share delta
            │  └── it should revert with NoShareDelta
            └── given Morpho returns positive share delta
               ├── it should pull assets from vault
               ├── it should credit supply shares to the callback
               ├── it should leave zero loan token and allowance in adapter
               └── it should emit MidnightCallbackAction
